{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong><br>Jump your way across the rooftops of a sprawling city. One fall sends you back to the very beginning. Use vaults, wall kicks, wall runs, and bar grabs to ascend higher and higher in this challenging parkour action game. Stay focused and keep retrying as you push toward the heights above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high-stakes retry-based game where even a single mistake means starting over</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A parkour system that demands a variety of precise movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level design that takes you from urban rooftops to towering structures</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935570?t=1762268728","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935570?t=1762268728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/8348bc527f11a024b22258b535aa799bd850bc44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762268728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/8348bc527f11a024b22258b535aa799bd850bc44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762268728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong><br>Jump your way across the rooftops of a sprawling city. One fall sends you back to the very beginning. Use vaults, wall kicks, wall runs, and bar grabs to ascend higher and higher in this challenging parkour action game. Stay focused and keep retrying as you push toward the heights above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><